Their exact source files and full notices are in assets/collections/ (also
THIRD_PARTY/collections/ in binary releases). Their authors retain copyright;
these collections are not relicensed under the application license. Consult
assets/collections/README.md for the inclusion review and collection-specific
terms. Copyright, permissions and author notes are also available in About.

The shared/ reference directory itself is never distributed. No YASC program
code, third-party artwork, or sounds are bundled.

Third-party Rust crates are listed with exact versions in Cargo.lock;
their licenses apply to those crates independently. The bundled executable's
dependency and font notices are in bin/THIRD_PARTY/.

